# headwear/helm/spangen: the Spangenhelm (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD; form4): the Fjordfolk's open helm. A low cone
# of four plates rising to a point, lit as a cone (the lit left plane in step 3, the turn in 2, the shadow in 1; a glint
# by the point), the frame band up the front (R) and the plate joins (N), a riveted brow band (P, its rivets R) over the
# rim (R) on the brow row (F-25 man, F-24 woman), and a short nasal down the nose facing down; facing R / L the nasal rides
# in front of the nose so the nose pixel shows. The eyes, nose and mouth always show; the beard and braids hang free
# below. '-' masks the hair under the cone. Shared by both bodies (D10). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role helm form4
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
tags overlay

# (FORGE-HELM i2, crown_tweak.py) the crown mark two rows down the dome: the crest rides the dome, never over the frame top (B10)
# (FORGE-HELM i3, crown3.py) mark crown one row under the tip (a crest rises over the cone instead of hiding in it)

view D key rest origin 2 1
mark crown 9 2
